        "created_at": "2016-02-24T15:56:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Could someone remind me what the sequence is when Haka defeats a Shinobi, and he has Dominion out?</p><p>Does Shinobi go on top of his deck, and then he draws?</p><p>Or does he draw and then put Shinobi on top of his deck?</p><p>And how does this work out if Haka also has Savage Mana out? What's the order of Shinobi-to-top-of-deck, drawing a card, and putting a card beneath SM?</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
